# Claude / Anthropic - Loon remote rules
# Updated: 2026-11-03
# Select the desired policy when importing this list into Loon.
# Place before general AI/Google/payment rules for this policy to take priority.
# Domain routing only: this list does not select or verify an exit IP.
#
# Claude / Anthropic
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
#
# Shared Google sign-in endpoint; also affects sign-ins outside Claude.
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com
#
# Shared Stripe payment/CDN endpoints; also affects payments outside Claude.
# Matching exits do not guarantee payment approval or cover bank-hosted 3DS pages.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stripe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stripe.network
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stripecdn.com
#
# Format: https://github.com/Loon0x00/LoonExampleConfig/blob/master/Rule/ExampleRule.list
# Stripe domains: https://docs.stripe.com/ips
